gc_pref_header_translation_settings: Translation Settings
gc_pref_default_target_lang: Default Target Language
gc_pref_default_target_lang_summary: Preferred language for translations
gc_pref_use_advanced_model: Use Advanced NMT Model
gc_pref_use_advanced_model_summary: Enable Google's premium Neural Machine Translation model (may incur higher costs)

gc_pref_header_performance: Performance Settings
gc_pref_timeout: Request Timeout (ms)
gc_pref_timeout_summary: Maximum time to wait for API response (5000-120000 ms)
gc_pref_max_retries: Max Retry Attempts
gc_pref_max_retries_summary: Number of retry attempts on transient failures (0-5)

gc_pref_header_advanced: Advanced Features
gc_pref_enable_cache: Enable Translation Cache
gc_pref_enable_cache_summary: Cache translated texts to reduce API calls and improve speed
gc_pref_cache_expiration: Cache Expiration (minutes)
gc_pref_cache_expiration_summary: How long to keep translations in cache
gc_pref_clear_cache: Clear Cache
gc_pref_clear_cache_summary: Remove all cached translations

